\newlabel{fig:l1-control-policy}{{7}{11}{Pilot L1 control-policy simulation using predicted one-step L1 phases from the cross-family tree. Blue bars show modeled L1 power savings after the two-interval confirmation filter. Teal bars show an oracle upper bound that uses the true next L1 phase. Red bars show underprovision risk, where the selected action is smaller than the true next L1 phase demand}{figure.7}{}}
